{
  "_doc": "小程序核验页的表单规则（甲方 2026-09-24 测试问题记录表第 20 行：核验要小程序和工作台都能做；Kevin 定这次做，推翻 CR-20260917-05「小程序里不做核验」）。被测纯函数在 code/miniapp/src/pages/verify/rules.ts，后端规则是权威（SampleVerifyService + SubmitSegmentRules / EmbedVerifyService + EmbedFillRules），与工作台 SampleDrawer / EmbedDrawer 逐项对齐。★ 两个接口的「改过才提交」形状不同：样本的 submitSegment 是整段替换（没给的键写成空）——送检信息一项没改就不带 submitSegment；改了任一项就带整段、没改的项带原值（只带改过的键会把别的项清空，实测后端回「组织类型不能为空」）。石蜡包埋的 fill 是补丁——只带改过的键，一项没改就不带；判无效只收样本类型、类器官来源类型，改过的实验室补填项在原因面板里列出来（不静默丢）。代数 passage（A 组加的列）：详情里有这个键就当送检段的普通一项；详情里没有也没改就不发。sampleCases 的 detail = 详情接口返回（/mp/int/sample/{id}），edits = 用户在页面上改了什么，me = 当前登录人（操作人为空时的默认值）。embedCases 的 detail = /mp/int/embed/{id} 返回，sampleValid = 所挂样本是否已核验有效。",
  "sampleFields": {
    "tissue": {
      "submit": ["sourceUnitName", "donorName", "gender", "age", "hospitalNo", "tissueType", "hasPathology", "remark"],
      "receive": ["receiveDate", "internalNo", "isFixed", "processTime", "hasQcSheet", "hasViabilityReport", "operatorName"],
      "requiredValid": ["sourceUnitName", "tissueType", "receiveDate", "internalNo"],
      "requiredInvalid": ["sourceUnitName", "tissueType"]
    },
    "organoid": {
      "submit": ["sourceUnitName", "organoidType", "passage", "remark"],
      "receive": ["receiveDate", "internalNo", "processTime", "hasViabilityReport", "operatorName"],
      "requiredValid": ["sourceUnitName", "organoidType", "receiveDate", "internalNo"],
      "requiredInvalid": ["sourceUnitName", "organoidType"]
    }
  },
